IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DRV-DISCOUNT.
*> Hand-written reference for the make_driver contract (see contract.py).
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-LINE PIC X(256).
01 T1 PIC X(64).
01 T2 PIC X(64).
01 T3 PIC X(64).
01 P1 PIC X.
01 P2 PIC 9(7)V99.
01 P3 PIC 9(2)V99.
01 E2 PIC 9(7).99.
01 E3 PIC 9(2).99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT IN-LINE
    UNSTRING IN-LINE DELIMITED BY "|" INTO T1 T2 T3
    MOVE T1 TO P1
    COMPUTE P2 = FUNCTION NUMVAL(T2)
    COMPUTE P3 = FUNCTION NUMVAL(T3)
    CALL 'DISCOUNT' USING P1 P2 P3
    MOVE P2 TO E2
    MOVE P3 TO E3
    DISPLAY "LK-TIER=" P1 "|LK-SUBTOTAL=" E2 "|LK-RATE=" E3
    STOP RUN.
